# LISPBSD: GENERIC without the built-in i915 KMS driver and without genfb on
# PCI, so the patched i915drmkms module (Tiger Lake force-probe) can claim the
# GPU when loaded from /etc/modules.conf. Console output appears once the DRM
# module attaches (intelfb); the machine is always reachable over ssh.
include "arch/amd64/conf/GENERIC"
#ident "LISPBSD-$Revision$"
no i915drmkms* at pci?
no intelfb* at intelfbbus?
no genfb* at pci?
